  "question": {
    "text": "Two circular rings of identical radii and resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>&nbsp;are placed as shown in the figure. Conducting joints are made at points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;a cell of emf&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;is connected between these two points. What is the power (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>) delivered by the cell? [<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;are the centres of the two rings]<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0073_9271838e7d08.png\" style=\"width: 197px; height: 159px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "100",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the figure.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; AC<sub>1</sub> = AC<sub>2</sub> = C<sub>1</sub> C<sub>2</sub> = radius<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>∠</mo> <msub> <mtext>AC</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0073_348b317cefdc.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 186px;\" /></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0073_1b31826ca0e8.jpg\" style=\"height: 217px; width: 150px;\" /></p><p>In between A and B, 4 resistances are in parallel&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0073_cb5173d059ff.jpg\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 185px;\" /><br /><br />Hence the resistance of four sections are in parallel<br />Hence equivalent resistance R across AB is<br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mi>Ω</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo>&nbsp; </mrow> </math> Power&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>V</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>&nbsp;watt</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;</p>"
  }
